<title>ITALY: TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN MEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN MEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the $2.3</p>
<p>million Italian Open men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seed):</p>
<p>6-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>10-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Karim Alami (Morocco) 4-6 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>7-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Jim Courier (U.S.) 6-3 3-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4)</p>
<p>Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Marc-Kevin Goellner (Germany) 7-5 7-5.</p>
</text>
